      "writtenOn": "2024-12-24T07:33:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just realized that we also have `byte[] getHardwareAddress()` in NetworkInterface. If no obvious, agreed that using `NetworkInterface#getFlags ` and `NetworkInterface#getHardwareAddress` is easier.\n\n\u003e This might require some refactoring because moving an interface in and out of tethering mode also calls addInterface()\n\nYou mean we might encounter race condition when moving in and out tethering mode?\nLooking at the code:\n```\n            removeInterface(mTetheringInterface);\n            addInterface(mTetheringInterface);\n```\n\nIt is added after removal but not the reverse. So maybe it should be okay?",
